sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant Browser
  participant App
  participant Auth as Authorization Server
  participant API
  User->>Browser: sign in
  Browser->>App: GET /login
  App-->>Browser: redirect with client id
  Browser->>Auth: authorize request
  Auth-->>Browser: login + consent
  Browser->>Auth: credentials approved
  Auth-->>Browser: authorization code
  Browser->>App: callback with code
  App->>Auth: exchange code + verifier
  Auth-->>App: access token
  App->>API: request profile
  API-->>App: profile JSON
  App-->>Browser: secure session cookie
  Note over Browser,App: browser never sees client secret
